WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:05.564
Ringo's ship flew toward Concert Planet.

2
00:00:05.565 --> 00:00:09.018
PJ and Lucy flew behind it.

3
00:00:09.019 --> 00:00:13.080
They were in Diva's ship.

4
00:00:13.081 --> 00:00:17.008
Ringo spoke to Lucy through a headset.

5
00:00:17.009 --> 00:00:19.467
"Everything is fine.

6
00:00:19.468 --> 00:00:24.629
I don't see that cargo ship."

7
00:00:24.630 --> 00:00:28.625
Suddenly a red dot flashed on the screen.

8
00:00:28.626 --> 00:00:32.468
"Uh-oh!" Ringo said.

9
00:00:32.469 --> 00:00:36.666
"I see it now!"

10
00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:51.306
The cargo ship flew to Diva's ship.

11
00:00:51.307 --> 00:00:54.932
Whoosh! Its big claw shot out.

12
00:00:54.933 --> 00:00:57.694
The claw tried to grab Diva's ship.

13
00:00:57.695 --> 00:01:00.600
But it missed!

14
00:01:00.601 --> 00:01:04.313
Ringo's spaceship zigzagged through space.

15
00:01:04.314 --> 00:01:09.641
Diva's spaceship zigzagged after him.

16
00:01:09.642 --> 00:01:15.672
The claw shot out again.

17
00:01:15.673 --> 00:01:18.833
"Be careful, Lucy!" Ringo said.

18
00:01:18.834 --> 00:01:22.039
"It almost got you that time!"

19
00:01:22.040 --> 00:01:25.965
Ringo glanced around.

20
00:01:25.966 --> 00:01:27.782
"I see a big space rock.

21
00:01:27.783 --> 00:01:33.249
Hide behind it!"

22
00:01:33.250 --> 00:01:37.800
PJ flew to the rock.

23
00:01:37.801 --> 00:01:41.113
Bot made sharp turns.

24
00:01:41.114 --> 00:01:50.026
She flew up and down.

25
00:01:50.027 --> 00:02:04.787
The cargo ship chased her.

26
00:02:04.788 --> 00:02:09.871
But then it found Diva's ship.

27
00:02:09.872 --> 00:02:15.505
The huge claw shot out.

28
00:02:15.506 --> 00:02:20.600
"It grabbed Diva's ship!" Ringo said.

29
00:02:20.601 --> 00:02:24.520
A door on the cargo ship opened.

30
00:02:24.521 --> 00:02:32.067
The claw put Diva's ship inside!

